OL,3,GNEWSAPlay area's #100,000 refurbishment
OL,4,Ato start                               
OL,6,FA #100,000 improvement scheme for a    
OL,7,Fplay area in Nottinghamshire is due to 
OL,8,Fstart next week.                       
OL,10,FThe refurbishment at The Hook in Lady  
OL,11,FBay, West Bridgford, will see a        
OL,12,Frefreshed playground featuring 14 new  
OL,13,Fpieces of equipment, including a       
OL,14,Fclimbing and play unit with a slide, an
OL,15,Faccessible roundabout and sensory play 
OL,16,Fpanel.                                 
OL,18,FThe works, due to begin on Tuesday, are
OL,19,Fexpected to take a few weeks to        
OL,20,Fcomplete and, weather permitting, the  
OL,21,Fplay park will reopen in time for the  
OL,22,FChristmas holidays.                    
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
